      "text": "Next, technical meetings at UNION and EA will focus on crop and resource management, improving yields and profitability, research and new crop-production technologies. After lunch, we travel to Trenque Lauquen, with hotel check-in and dinner on arrival. The day’s drive is approximately 350 km.",
